{% comment %}
    STAFF (CONCEPT DATA) — the people on the staff page, written out by hand
    until the page is built from Rock. It outputs a JSON array (in the order
    shown); StaffPhotos.lava and StaffDetail.lava capture it and read it with
    FromJSON (an include's own assigns don't reach the page that includes it):

        {%- capture staffJson %}{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Partials/StaffConcept.lava' %}{% endcapture -%}
        {%- assign staffList = staffJson | FromJSON -%}

      Key     the address key (?Staff= on the detail page, ?staff= on the list)
      Team    the staff page groups people by it (StaffPhotos.lava staffTeams;
              anyone else goes in a last "More of our team" section), and the
              detail page shows it over the name
      Photo   the file name stem in Assets/Images/Staff_Photos: <Photo>_a.webp
              (everyday) and <Photo>_b.webp (the fun one), transparent
              cut-outs 934×1280
      Tone    the card's colour: lime, sky, coral or sand (Styles/_staff.scss),
              taken in turn down the page
      Bio     paragraphs

    Names, titles and emails: the current staff page (www.vrl.church/about/
    our-staff), except Brittany's title (Executive Admin, as asked).
    Teams: from the titles. PLACEHOLDERS: every bio except Brittany's; the
    teams of Brittany (Executive Team), Jolene (Women's Ministry) and Kjell
    (Operations), which aren't one of the four.
{% endcomment %}
[
  { "Key": "tyler-lane", "First": "Tyler", "Name": "Tyler Lane", "Title": "Next Generation Team Leader", "Team": "Next Gen", "Email": "lane@vrl.church", "Photo": "TylerLane", "Tone": "lime",
    "Bio": ["A short bio goes here: what Tyler does at VRL, and something fun about them."] },
